// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`course «Объясни ещё» prompts (T90 D9) > a card target asks for a fresh English re-explanation with three new examples 1`] = `
"Lesson card: «В + предложный»

The ending is -е for masculine nouns.

Examples from the card:
- Я живу в большом городе."
`;

exports[`course «Объясни ещё» prompts (T90 D9) > an item target names the chosen option as wrong and gives the authored explanation 1`] = `
"Exercise sentence: «Я читаю о …»
Topic: case-prep
Options: «Москва», «Москве», «Москву»
Correct answer: «Москве»
The learner chose: «Москву» (wrong)
The authored explanation the learner already read: Trigger: о + где? …"
`;
